Vendored Blitz patches
Origin: https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz
Commit: 92b11f1bd8ab7975411328b0406a95a09445b4e7
Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (Apache-2.0 selected).
Copied paths: third-party/blitz-dom and third-party/blitz-paint (complete
source and required assets for exactly these two crates). Other Blitz crates
remain pinned Git dependencies. Cargo's [patch] replaces these two packages
with the vendored copies in every build; no checkout mutation is required.
Changes from pinned upstream (each file carries a 4(b) modification header):
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/util.rs: lazily scope the SVG font database to
  host-font opt-in and supplied in-memory fonts.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/layout/construct.rs: replace C0/C1 controls
  with U+FFFD, initialize static control labels, preserve inline edges, and
  constrain disclosure-marker line metrics without collapsing empty summaries.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/layout/mod.rs: invoke auto-table distribution,
  size static controls by count attributes, and position rendered fieldset
  legends while reserving shared block-start border space for content.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/layout/inline.rs: align native-appearance
  checkbox/radio/range baselines with resolved bottom insets and calibrate
  native color baselines from all vertical insets; preserve the margin-box
  baseline without native appearance, measure inline span edges, and suppress
  empty line boxes between overflowing atomic inlines.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/node/node.rs: exclude synthetic inline edge
  advances from reported text-content fragments.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/layout/table.rs: measure min/max cell width,
  distribute excess definite auto-table width by max-content proportions,
  and remove extra vertical gutters between collapsed-border rows.
- third-party/blitz-dom/src/net.rs: use CSS normal weight 400 when a static
  @font-face weight descriptor cannot be resolved.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/text.rs: apply nine-offset synthetic bold,
  respect synthesis opt-out and intrinsic OS/2 weight, and tint placeholders.
- third-party/blitz-dom/assets/default.css: adapt native form-control
  defaults; original upstream MPL-2.0 header is preserved.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/render/form_controls.rs: paint static check,
  radio, range, color and select decoration, honoring appearance:none.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/layers.rs: composite blend groups while retaining
  the unchanged normal layer path.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/render.rs: capture overflowing effect subtrees
  in composite groups, including their outlines and shadows, and paint the
  fieldset top border centered on the rendered legend with an unpainted notch.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/render/clip_path.rs: resolve circle percentage
  radii using the normalized diagonal of the reference box.
- third-party/blitz-paint/src/filters.rs: reject unsupported filter function
  lists atomically instead of silently dropping a function.
Reproducible upstream comparisons are checked in as
third-party/blitz-dom.patch and third-party/blitz-paint.patch. They cover
